 Haiku 5.5, but 2 hard-coded defaults in `src/rebar` still name the old generation:\n- `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/registry.py:448`: `chunk_by_facet(..., model: str = \"claude-sonnet-4-6\", ...)`. The production caller (`pass1.py:285`) passes `cfg.model`, so a call that omits `model` sizes chunks for the wrong model.\n- `src/rebar/llm/evals/fixture_emit.py:18`: `_MODEL = \"anthropic:claude-sonnet-4-6\"`, which is stamped into emitted eval fixtures.\n\nThe 4.x entries in `capabilities.py` and `model_classes.py` are per-model tables, not defaults, and may stay.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] `chunk_by_facet` takes no old-generation default: either `model` is required or it defaults to the configured standard class.\n- [ ] `fixture_emit` stamps a current-generation model or the configured one.\n- [ ] A test fails if a function default or module constant in `src/rebar` names a pre-5.5 Claude id outside the per-model capability tables.\n- [ ] `make verify` exits 0.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"ac9f-db05-bc10-41a0","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Old-generation model ids in src/rebar defaults","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["461faa8c-5fd6-443b-9243-550c20b5f80b","d25adb3a-28f0-4777-a8a1-b3ac6cb41fe8"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794547737759634002,"uuid":"5df4ddb6-c56b-42bb-88be-ca1617dc20a3"}